# Private family device evidence

Copy this form to ignored `operator-config/family/device-evidence.md` only for optional future observations. Keep completed records private and share only sanitized observations. Unperformed observations are not passed tests and do not reopen the resolved family-testing requirements.

## Accepted scope

- [x] Console/family-member testing requirements resolved by Craig's user acceptance/waiver on October 3, 2026; issue #9 is closed on that basis.
- Reported joins: Craig's Java client on Mac, Bedrock on iPhone and two iPads; four simultaneous players.
- PS5/Switch: untested. BedrockConnect: never configured.
- Chat, interaction, reconnect, inventory, denial, six-player and console validations: not recorded as passed; family-testing acceptance was waived.

Acceptance reference: [owner acceptance record](https://github.com/CraigDevJohnson/minecraft/issues/9#issuecomment-5972110637).

